# A data file's text as a dynamic value, keys in snake case. `read` is loaded from the file that DEFINES it: the
# file module's `read` has the same name and the same parameter types, so the call is bound by import, and an import
# through `@term/host/code/base` (which only re-exports it) did not count, so the name read as undefined.

load @term/host/code/read
  find read

load @term/host/code/json
  find to-dynamic

task data-value
  take body, like text
  like dynamic
  send back
    call to-dynamic
      call read
        read body
